osbmonitor (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First automated .deb/.plasmoid/RPM release via GitHub Actions.
  * Fixed License metadata (was "GPL", LICENSE file was even the wrong
    license text entirely — LGPL addendum instead of GPL-3.0-or-later).
  * osc added as a runtime dependency (main.qml shells out to it).
  * CMakeLists.txt no longer requires a C++ toolchain (pure QML plasmoid).

